  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A spaceship travels from Planet X to Planet Y at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.9c\"></span>. The two planets are stationary relative to each other. Observer A on the spaceship measures that the journey takes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> hours and Observer B, who is stationary on the surface of Planet X, measures that the distance travelled by the spaceship is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is true about the time the journey takes as measured by Observer B and the distance travelled by the spaceship as measured by Observer A?</p>\n\n<div class=\"table-responsive\"><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\textbf{Time of the journey}\"></span>\n<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\textbf{as measured by Observer B}\"></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\textbf{Distance travelled by the spaceship}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\textbf{as measured by Observer A}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></td>\n<td>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></td>\n<td>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>"
  },
